<**********   Help   **********>

Each line starting with a '*' is a menu selection.


<********   Overview   ********>
       YAP is a program intended to visualize slices of 3D (or 2D) grids

It can be run either by typing "yap" or with some command line arguments.

Type "yap -h" to get a description of the command line arguments.

